    <briefdescription>
<para>Cross section of a hard body, i.e. its projection onto a plane. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A convex hull (convex polygon) dilated by a radius, i.e. all the points lying within the radius of the polygon. Coordinates are in meters, relative to the object position: they need no translation.</para>
<para>The convex hull vertices must be:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Sorted clockwise, consistently with ostk::mathematics::geometry::d2::object::Polygon (any vertex first)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Not closed: the first vertex is not repeated at the end</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Vertices of the polygon only: no duplicate, collinear or interior points</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>One or two vertices are also allowed (point or segment).</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".cpp"><codeline><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Circle<sp/>of<sp/>radius<sp/>1.0<sp/>m</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">HardBody::CrossSection<sp/>circle<sp/>=<sp/>{<sp/>Array&lt;Point&gt;({<sp/>{<sp/>0.0,<sp/>0.0<sp/>}<sp/>}),<sp/>1.0<sp/>}<sp/>;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Square<sp/>of<sp/>side<sp/>1.0<sp/>m</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">HardBody::CrossSection<sp/>square<sp/>=<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>Array&lt;Point&gt;({<sp/>{<sp/>0.5,<sp/>0.5<sp/>},<sp/>{<sp/>0.5,<sp/>-0.5<sp/>},<sp/>{<sp/>-0.5,<sp/>-0.5<sp/>},<sp/>{<sp/>-0.5,<sp/>0.5<sp/>}<sp/>}),<sp/>0.0</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}<sp/>;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Stadium:<sp/>segment<sp/>of<sp/>length<sp/>2.0<sp/>m<sp/>dilated<sp/>by<sp/>a<sp/>radius<sp/>of<sp/>0.5<sp/>m<sp/>(total<sp/>size<sp/>3.0<sp/>m<sp/>x<sp/>1.0<sp/>m)</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">HardBody::CrossSection<sp/>stadium<sp/>=<sp/>{<sp/>Array&lt;Point&gt;({<sp/>{<sp/>-1.0,<sp/>0.0<sp/>},<sp/>{<sp/>1.0,<sp/>0.0<sp/>}<sp/>}),<sp/>0.5<sp/>}<sp/>;</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
